1
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:52,400
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:55,920
(This story is entirely fictional.
All settings are imaginary.)

3
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:58,920
=Episode 12=

4
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:06,640
This is bad.

5
00:01:06,959 --> 00:01:07,760
They're all here.

6
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:13,719
You guys,

7
00:01:13,719 --> 00:01:14,560
cover Mian and get him out first.

8
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:15,159
You go first.

9
00:01:15,519 --> 00:01:16,959
I'm not the fool I used to be.

10
00:01:16,959 --> 00:01:17,519
Come on.

11
00:01:17,519 --> 00:01:18,000
Don't be reckless.

12
00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:19,879
Find an opening and get out.

13
00:01:21,439 --> 00:01:21,760
Get them!

14
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:50,200
Get in the car!

15
00:01:50,359 --> 00:01:51,079
Ma Ding, get out of there!

16
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:05,959
Ma Ding!

17
00:02:12,599 --> 00:02:13,000
Open the door!

18
00:02:25,479 --> 00:02:25,840
Stop the car!

19
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,479
I said stop the car!

20
00:02:27,879 --> 00:02:29,159
My only job is to protect Mian.

21
00:02:29,159 --> 00:02:30,159
Everyone else is on their own.

22
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:44,560
Go!

23
00:02:45,039 --> 00:02:46,120
Grandpa Ma's right here!

24
00:02:46,479 --> 00:02:47,159
Come get me!

25
00:03:09,719 --> 00:03:10,000
Go!

26
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:10,879
Next one.

27
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:46,479
Go!

28
00:03:48,919 --> 00:03:49,319
Who are you?

29
00:03:50,599 --> 00:03:52,280
We're family.

30
00:03:57,599 --> 00:03:57,800
Go.

31
00:04:03,199 --> 00:04:03,439
Go.

32
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:05,439
Go.

33
00:04:10,719 --> 00:04:11,439
Stop! Who are you?

34
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,479
Don't you recognize me?

35
00:04:13,479 --> 00:04:14,840
I work for Mr. Natuo.

36
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:16,439
I pay you guys regularly.

37
00:04:16,439 --> 00:04:18,040
Oh, you're with Mr. Natuo.

38
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:18,680
Go in.

39
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:19,759
Go.

40
00:04:19,759 --> 00:04:20,439
Don't let him get away!

41
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:22,800
Don't let him escape!

42
00:04:23,959 --> 00:04:24,600
Search carefully.

43
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,079
Don't miss a single spot.

44
00:04:28,079 --> 00:04:29,079
Check everywhere.

45
00:04:33,439 --> 00:04:34,199
Look under there.

46
00:04:43,959 --> 00:04:44,519
Spread out and search!

47
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:17,959
Buddy.

48
00:05:18,399 --> 00:05:20,319
Did you see an injured man run by?

49
00:05:20,879 --> 00:05:22,360
I've been working here. Didn't see him.

50
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,000
Didn't see?

51
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:26,439
Think carefully.
His hair's a little long.

52
00:05:26,759 --> 00:05:27,480
He's hurt.

53
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,279
He's wearing flip-flops.

54
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,920
I told you, I didn't see him.

55
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:31,959
You're stepping on my corn.

56
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,040
Go.

57
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:34,720
Move.

58
00:05:35,519 --> 00:05:36,319
Forget it.

59
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:38,120
Come on. Let's search somewhere else.

60
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:50,040
Hey, handsome.

61
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:51,480
Where are you going?

62
00:05:53,319 --> 00:05:53,920
Come over here.

63
00:05:57,519 --> 00:05:57,879
Come on.

64
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:58,639
Come down.

65
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,079
Hurry.

66
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:14,720
Go that way first.

67
00:06:29,959 --> 00:06:30,319
Young lady.

68
00:06:31,079 --> 00:06:32,800
Did you see an injured man come by?

69
00:06:33,399 --> 00:06:34,480
He was wearing red pants.

70
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:36,879
I think I did.

71
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,639
But he ran that way.

72
00:06:39,199 --> 00:06:39,480
That way?

73
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:41,759
Hurry, go after him.

74
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,120
Hey.

75
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:57,759
Don't worry.

76
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,439
I sent those guys the other way.

77
00:07:01,519 --> 00:07:01,800
Sit.

78
00:07:03,839 --> 00:07:04,639
Sit.

79
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:06,480
Sit down.

80
00:07:12,319 --> 00:07:12,720
Oh, no.

81
00:07:13,519 --> 00:07:14,600
You're bleeding.

82
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:15,920
I'll get you some medicine.

83
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:29,160
Hang in there.

84
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:31,480
Here.

85
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,160
Bear with me.

86
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:37,199
Sorry, sorry.

87
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:38,439
I'll be gentle.

88
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:14,839
Let me check again.

89
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:18,120
Why are you bleeding so much?

90
00:08:40,519 --> 00:08:41,759
You just left Ma Ding behind?

91
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:43,519
In Langia,

92
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:44,759
if you're not ruthless enough,

93
00:08:44,919 --> 00:08:45,919
you won't survive.

94
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,159
That's what Mian taught me.

95
00:08:47,759 --> 00:08:49,159
I'm Mian now.

96
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:51,600
I, Zhou Yan,
never leave a brother behind.

97
00:08:52,679 --> 00:08:53,559
If you ever do that again,

98
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:55,000
I'll cripple you myself.

99
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,200
- Boss.
- Boss.

100
00:08:58,039 --> 00:08:58,360
Boss.

101
00:08:58,799 --> 00:08:59,679
Everyone got separated.

102
00:09:00,519 --> 00:09:01,759
We don't know how Ma Ding is doing.

103
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:03,559
Gather those who can still move.

104
00:09:04,279 --> 00:09:05,080
We're going back for Ma Ding.

105
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:06,799
Okay.

106
00:09:09,039 --> 00:09:09,600
Boss.

107
00:09:10,879 --> 00:09:11,279
Ma Ding!

108
00:09:18,279 --> 00:09:19,080
You're back!

109
00:09:19,759 --> 00:09:20,279
How bad is it?

110
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:26,559
Don't be so reckless next time.

111
00:09:26,559 --> 00:09:27,399
Staying alive comes first.

112
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:29,039
Boss.

113
00:09:29,799 --> 00:09:31,600
I just became a boss in the Blaze Gang.

114
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:32,879
If I back down,

115
00:09:33,279 --> 00:09:34,200
who'll respect me?

116
00:09:35,399 --> 00:09:35,960
But Boss,

117
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:37,720
Natuo has money

118
00:09:38,399 --> 00:09:39,480
and the most muscle in Langia.

119
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,000
Suowen has the strongest connections
in Langia.

120
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,159
Now that they've teamed up,

121
00:09:44,519 --> 00:09:45,159
they won't be easy.

122
00:09:46,799 --> 00:09:47,159
Go in first.

123
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:52,120
Come on, Ma Ding.

124
00:09:52,639 --> 00:09:52,960
Sit here.

125
00:09:57,759 --> 00:09:58,759
Since they've joined forces,

126
00:09:59,399 --> 00:10:00,360
we'll split them up,

127
00:10:01,279 --> 00:10:02,279
then take them down one by one.

128
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:06,840
Don't worry.

129
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,080
I won't let any of you get hurt again.

130
00:10:24,879 --> 00:10:25,440
Sorry.

131
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:26,960
I didn't know you...

132
00:10:30,799 --> 00:10:33,240
Mr. Mian,
I hear you just dealt with Dashan.

133
00:10:34,039 --> 00:10:34,879
You rushed over here.

134
00:10:35,519 --> 00:10:36,919
Here to deal with me too?

135
00:10:39,639 --> 00:10:40,919
I'm here because your stepson

136
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,639
teamed up with Suowen against me.

137
00:10:45,639 --> 00:10:47,159
That's between you men.

138
00:10:47,159 --> 00:10:48,519
What's that got to do with me?

139
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:52,240
Natuo's in the drug business
with Suowen.

140
00:10:52,879 --> 00:10:53,799
And it's getting bigger.

141
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,600
My stepson's doing so well.

142
00:10:57,480 --> 00:11:00,279
As his stepmother, why shouldn't I
just sit back and enjoy it?

143
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:04,639
Ms. Layla, are you really going to

144
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:07,240
give up what's practically yours?

145
00:11:09,519 --> 00:11:10,159
You can go.

146
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:16,000
Mr. Mian.

147
00:11:16,919 --> 00:11:18,000
Then come in and help me.

148
00:11:26,519 --> 00:11:26,919
What?

149
00:11:27,639 --> 00:11:29,360
Don't tell me you're new to this.

150
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:30,039
Why so shy?

151
00:11:56,919 --> 00:11:57,559
Lately,

152
00:11:58,000 --> 00:12:00,080
Natuo's gained a lot of clout
in the Songcai family.

153
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:01,919
Mr. Mian.

154
00:12:02,399 --> 00:12:03,159
Any ideas?

155
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:06,679
I'll handle your stepson myself.

156
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:10,320
But he's teamed up with Suowen.

157
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:13,159
I need you to split them up.

158
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,120
I hear

159
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:21,120
Natuo's moving a lot of white stuff.

160
00:12:22,519 --> 00:12:23,120
And

161
00:12:23,559 --> 00:12:25,000
Suowen's old clients

162
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:27,000
are going straight to Natuo now.

163
00:12:27,919 --> 00:12:28,519
Tell me,

164
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:31,519
isn't someone poaching Suowen's clients?

165
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:37,440
Thank you, Ms. Layla.

166
00:12:38,759 --> 00:12:40,519
I'll have someone
look into that for you.

167
00:12:45,919 --> 00:12:47,919
But I need one more favor from you,
Ms. Layla.

168
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:49,720
What is it?

169
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:00,720
You're so bad.

170
00:13:16,160 --> 00:13:17,760
♪Dust rises along the border♪

171
00:13:17,760 --> 00:13:19,080
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

172
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:20,440
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

173
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:21,840
♪Brothers yesterday, foes today♪

174
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,200
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

175
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:24,520
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

176
00:13:24,520 --> 00:13:25,840
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

177
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:27,520
♪My life is mine to bear♪

178
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:30,360
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

179
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:32,960
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

180
00:13:33,280 --> 00:13:35,280
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

181
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:36,360
♪My fate is mine to command♪

182
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:37,640
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

183
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:38,920
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

184
00:13:39,160 --> 00:13:40,240
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

185
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:41,520
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

186
00:13:41,760 --> 00:13:42,880
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

187
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:44,200
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

188
00:13:44,400 --> 00:13:45,520
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

189
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:46,800
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

190
00:13:47,040 --> 00:13:48,160
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

191
00:13:48,560 --> 00:13:49,680
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

192
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:51,080
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

193
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:52,440
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

194
00:13:52,560 --> 00:13:55,480
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

195
00:13:57,760 --> 00:13:59,160
♪With blood and sweat♪

196
00:13:59,280 --> 00:14:00,560
♪I forge my glory♪

197
00:14:00,880 --> 00:14:01,960
♪In this world of chaos♪

198
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:03,040
♪I carve out a road to brighter days♪

199
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:04,520
♪My legend♪

200
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:06,000
♪I'll write every chapter myself♪

201
00:14:11,040 --> 00:14:13,160
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

202
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:16,000
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

203
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:18,120
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

204
00:14:18,280 --> 00:14:19,400
♪My fate is mine to command♪

205
00:14:19,760 --> 00:14:20,680
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

206
00:14:28,880 --> 00:14:29,960
♪My fate is mine to command♪

207
00:14:30,160 --> 00:14:31,720
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪
